## 🔮 Advanced Version

A more advanced architecture can replace simple intent classification with a retrieval or generative pipeline:

```text
User Query
     ↓
NLP Processing
     ↓
Semantic Search
     ↓
Medical Knowledge Base
     ↓
Relevant Information
     ↓
Response Generation
     ↓
Safety Validation
     ↓
Final Response
```

This can improve the chatbot's ability to handle questions that are not exact matches to the training dataset.

---

## 📌 Limitations

* Performance depends heavily on dataset quality.
* The chatbot may not understand complex medical questions.
* It may fail on queries outside its training domain.
* TF-IDF-based systems have limited semantic understanding.
* Responses are not equivalent to professional medical advice.
* Medical information requires careful validation and maintenance.

